        "name": {
          "en-US": "Recall"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Flashcards at natural moments, run as a trading desk for memory"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "NJ's personal flashcard app. Due cards appear right after unlocking the phone\nand after 15 minutes in a scrolling app; a spaced-repetition scheduler (FSRS)\ndecides when each card comes back. Every card is a position on a trading\ndesk: the book loses value while cards wait, and reviewing earns points,\nranks and awards. Cards come from NJ's Google Sheet; the app needs a setup\ncode to connect, so it does nothing useful for anyone else."
        },
