        "authorName": "NJ",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Teraz"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "NJ's commitments and next actions, with Done, sparks and a widget"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "NJ's personal app for the commitments in his own to-do sheet: each with\none next action, its day and how often it slipped. One tap marks a\nnext action done, \"Ask Claude\" sends a commitment to the Claude app, and a\nspark (an idea for later) takes two seconds from the app, the widget or the\nshare sheet. The app needs a setup code to connect, so it does nothing useful\nfor anyone else."
        },
